  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is green throughout, about the size of an adult’s thumb, split into six caterpillar segments, with a silver horn on its forehead.",
        "chapters": [
          1457
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Snack Immortal Gu soon supplements perseverance Immortal Gu, self love Immortal Gu, and wood sprout Immortal Gu so green light shine fungi can become pure white light shine fungi suited to the sky.",
        "chapters": [
          1458
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "other-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_perseverance_gu",
          "gu_self_love_immortal_gu",
          "gu_wood_sprout_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later makes it the core of immortal killer move eat strength to spend strength path immortal materials for strength path dao marks.",
        "chapters": [
          1465
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "other-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He also notes that refining it into rank seven Big Snack would strengthen that eat strength gain, but he puts that refinement off.",
        "chapters": [
          1467
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "other-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_big_snack_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At dragon scale sea area it is one of four Immortal Gu cores in a new immortal Gu formation.",
        "chapters": [
          1471
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "other-uses",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_formation"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After red date immortal essence, its body shakes, turns red then lava-like, thickens, and spits sticky yellowish liquid before shrinking pale. That liquid can replace part of other Immortal Gu food, about six percent per use for rank six targets, weaker for rank seven, and at most forty percent of a Gu’s food overall. Continuous use past its limit can kill it; it must heal until it turns green again before the next use.",
        "chapters": [
          1457
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding-effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "At white crane sea area, narration still counts Snack as Fang Yuan’s only food path Immortal Gu, and Eat Fragrance, salvaged there from Qin Bai He’s Bai He Palace, is the first to join it and ease that shortfall.",
        "chapters": [
          1487
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sole-food-path-immortal-gu-until-eat-fragrance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
